<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#060e18] py-20 sm:py-24 border-t border-white/10">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.72fr_1.28fr] lg:items-start">
      <div>
        <div class="chip mb-4 border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/10">
          <span class="mini-label text-emerald-300">Founder Commitment</span>
        </div>
        <p
          class="max-w-sm text-base font-semibold leading-relaxed text-slate-200 font-heading"
        >
          Why I'm personally onboarding the first 10 stores.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <div class="relative pl-6 border-l-2 border-emerald-500/40">
          <div
            class="text-xl font-semibold leading-[1.35] text-white sm:text-2xl lg:text-[1.75rem] font-heading"
          >
            <span class="text-emerald-400 block mb-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold font-mono">My 10x Value Standard</span>
            "Boutique founders shouldn't have to stay awake until 2 AM manually replying to 'Price?' comments and texting bank details. Our standard is simple: VoluChat must deliver at least 10x the value of what you pay, or we haven't earned your business."
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="mt-8 grid gap-5 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:items-center"
        >
          <p
            class="max-w-2xl text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-slate-300"
          >
            For our 10 pilot fashion stores, I am personally managing the technical setup: syncing your catalog &amp; size charts, configuring Meta Cloud APIs, and tuning the AI stylist on your brand voice until your DM conversions visibly double.
          </p>

          <!-- Monogram avatar block for founder -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0 lg:justify-end">
            <div
              class="grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/15 border border-emerald-500/30 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-emerald-300 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(16,185,129,0.2)]"
            >
              VG
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-bold text-white">Vaibhav Goyal</p>
              <p class="text-[10px] font-medium text-emerald-400">
                Founder & Engineer, VoluChat
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
